苯甲酸钠，并把它带到下面新形成的水层中。

79
00:05:22,580 --> 00:05:27,660
To make sure the reaction goes to completion, we need to mix the contents of the funnel.
为确保反应完全，我们需要把漏斗里的东西混合均匀。

80
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:32,820
We will do this by inverting it and lightly swirling a few times, holding the stopper down
做法是把漏斗倒转过来，轻轻旋摇几次，同时用一根手指

81
00:05:32,820 --> 00:05:37,220
with one finger as we do so to ensure that nothing spills out.
按住塞子，确保没有东西洒出来。

82
00:05:37,220 --> 00:05:39,700
Mix for about 10 seconds each time.
每次混合大约 10 秒。

83
00:05:39,700 --> 00:05:44,900
After each round of mixing, hold the funnel upside down and open the stopcock like this
每轮混合之后，把漏斗倒过来拿着，像这样打开旋塞，

84
00:05:44,980 --> 00:05:49,140
to vent any gases that accumulate from the reaction.
放掉反应中积聚的任何气体。

85
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:51,460
Close it, and then continue mixing.
关上旋塞，然后继续混合。

86
00:05:51,460 --> 00:05:55,340
When gases are vented, you will hear a brief hissing sound.
放气时，你会听到短暂的嘶嘶声。

87
00:05:55,340 --> 00:05:59,980
