现在你可以打开旋塞，让下层流入一个干净的烧瓶中。

93
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:20,220
This is where you have to be careful.
这里你必须小心。

94
00:06:20,220 --> 00:06:25,380
Watch the aqueous layer drip slowly so that you can stop it right before any of the top
看着水层慢慢滴下，这样你就能在上层

95
00:06:25,380 --> 00:06:27,020
layer goes through.
流出之前及时停住。

96
00:06:27,020 --> 00:06:31,500
When the line separating the layers reaches the stopcock, close it.
当两层之间的分界线到达旋塞时，关上旋塞。

97
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:34,020
You have now separated the two layers.
现在你已经把两层分开了。

98
00:06:34,020 --> 00:06:37,940
The top layer can be removed by pouring it through the top of the funnel into a
上层可以从漏斗顶部倒进

99
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:39,780
