solution acidic, which means the acid is in excess and the reaction is complete.
溶液变成酸性，这说明酸已经过量，反应已经完全。

139
00:09:18,530 --> 00:09:21,890
As benzoic acid forms, it will begin to precipitate.
随着苯甲酸的生成，它会开始沉淀出来。

140
00:09:21,890 --> 00:09:26,990
If this is happening very slowly, the flask can be placed in an ice bath or cold water
如果这个过程非常慢，可以把烧瓶放在冰浴或冷水

141
00:09:26,990 --> 00:09:30,050
