based on their chemical properties, namely their propensity to undergo an acid-base reaction.
化学性质，也就是它们发生酸碱反应的倾向，把它们分离开来。

149
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:11,540
This is an important tool that is used constantly in organic chemistry.
这是有机化学中经常使用的一个重要工具。

150
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:16,700
It is also widely used in industry for the extraction of natural products, ranging from
它在工业上也被广泛用于提取天然产物，范围从

